&lt;p&gt;after 550 CE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="excavation-dates"&gt;Excavation Dates&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;unexcavated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="garden-description"&gt;Garden Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Located in the western plain of the village. Size not given. Leased after 550 CE for an unknown period. Furnished with a palisade, open-air drying shed, chaff storehouse, and two wooden sakiyas. Includes palms, fruit orchard (&lt;em&gt;πωμάριον&lt;/em&gt;), and olive orchard. Document is fragmentary and no doubt other things were mentioned.&lt;/p&gt;
